Clinical Services
. 24-hour dispensing for inpatient and outpatient services
. Daily ward rounds and prescription review in medical, paediatric, surgical and maternity wards
. Patient medication counseling for chronic illnesses, TB and HIV
. Dose adjustment and drug interaction checks
. Antimicrobial stewardship support

Safety and Quality
. 100% screening of prescriptions for errors and interactions
